Test Case: Verify Admin Login Functionality
Test Case ID: TC001
Module: Authentication
Feature: Admin Login
Priority: High
Test Type: Functional
Description:
Verify that the admin can successfully log in to the application with valid credentials.

Preconditions:
Admin user account exists with valid credentials.
The application is up and running.
The admin login page is accessible.

Test Steps:
Open the application in a web browser or mobile device.
Navigate to the Admin Login page.
Enter the admin's valid username in the Username field.
Enter the admin's valid password in the Password field.
Click the Login button.

Test Data:
Field	Value
Username	admin_user
Password	Admin@123

Expected Result:
The admin is successfully authenticated.
The admin is redirected to the Admin Dashboard page.
The admin sees a personalized greeting or the correct admin dashboard.

Postconditions:
Admin session is active, and the application tracks the session for authorized activities.
The logout option is available on the dashboard.
Negative Test Cases (Optional):

Scenario	Expected Result
Login with an invalid username or password	Error message: "Invalid credentials."
Login with empty username or password fields	Error message: "Please enter all fields."

